{"sessionId":"L1-S21","number":21,"sessionTitle":"Ears Like a Bat","title":"The Bell in the Fog","titleCard":{"text":"Episode 21. The Bell in the Fog.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/title.ogg","dur":3.223,"env":"000ur60riqqhwturc0ca0fdrwrroaiptlmwvtrqnnpokb00000000000pr60zzzzwtrrstqutun666nxwvurponc3a0000000","words":[["Episode",0.1,1.09],["21.",1.09,1.5],["The",1.87,2.09],["Bell",2.09,2.37],["in",2.37,2.54],["the",2.54,2.77],["Fog.",2.77,2.99]],"voice":"narrator"},"previously":{"text":"Bolt was found with one clever rule. Then they heard a bell ringing in the fog…","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/prev.ogg","dur":5.946,"env":"000pzyxwvphmj27m68oivvssssrprp900000000000vzywub98kumh66xpqqqsrtq83skdnzwrsrbcavym5gyrprxzzwwwxwuo300000000000tyxsrrpqpj400rtrkktyzxv8vg0vzzxvwvmswtutvtsrsqssul45ixutsqoc080000000","words":[["Last",0.1,0.56],["time...",0.56,1.01],["Bolt",1.4,1.66],["was",1.66,1.87],["found",1.87,2.18],["with",2.18,2.44],["one",2.44,2.66],["clever",2.66,3.01],["rule.",3.01,3.27],["Then",3.66,3.9],["they",3.9,4.15],["heard",4.15,4.43],["a",4.43,4.54],["bell",4.54,4.79],["ringing",4.79,5.16],["in",5.16,5.32],["the",5.32,5.51],["fog…",5.51,5.71]],"voice":"narrator"},"scenes":[{"setting":"Dusk on the foggy hillside. Bats flit between the trees.","action":"A bat flies straight at a tree and swerves at the last moment. Close-up: little rings of sound leave the bat and bounce back from the tree.","seconds":40,"lines":[{"i":0,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"How do bats not crash? It’s dark AND foggy!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/0.ogg","dur":3.435,"env":"00000003cryqrnuyyzn70gmcstt82b5qpnjje8chkhie8000000000000000003tp0aljctzzve5jvzr34uzxnoj7eklmg200000000","words":[["How",0.26,0.49],["do",0.49,0.67],["bats",0.67,0.94],["not",0.94,1.17],["crash?",1.17,1.5],["It’s",1.85,2.13],["dark",2.13,2.47],["AND",2.47,2.74],["foggy!",2.74,3.14]],"voice":"amara"},{"i":1,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"They shout a tiny squeak — too high for us to hear — and listen for the echo.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/1.ogg","dur":5.424,"env":"003rutgopczvtmhmdh887rvtyvuuojpomj507uurl9006000000000000g7zuuul889agxtrh59aousjom4gnq896wwrppnmlf5000000000000009tvvstxuzxnipilrssi466shyykitsspa4bssrqqonh7000000","words":[["They",0.1,0.44],["shout",0.44,0.83],["a",0.83,0.98],["tiny",0.98,1.32],["squeak",1.32,1.77],["—",1.77,1.87],["too",1.87,2.14],["high",2.14,2.48],["for",2.48,2.75],["us",2.75,2.96],["to",2.96,3.18],["hear",3.18,3.51],["—",3.51,3.6],["and",3.6,3.88],["listen",3.88,4.33],["for",4.33,4.61],["the",4.61,4.88],["echo.",4.88,5.22]],"voice":"lucia"},{"i":2,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"A quick echo means: something is close!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/2.ogg","dur":2.881,"env":"006rh00iiihiytf0e8300irm0a7wrrssuvvtrrspoqnsvwuauqpe0avorrlyh2b965yvtsrojotstopk4000000","words":[["A",0.1,0.26],["quick",0.26,0.66],["echo",0.66,1.0],["means:",1.0,1.4],["something",1.4,2.05],["is",2.05,2.27],["close!",2.27,2.67]],"voice":"lucia"}]},{"setting":"Nana’s toolbox. A pair of round “eyes” that are really a tiny speaker and a tiny microphone.","action":"The Face Screen clicks off and goes into the toolbox. The Distance Eyes click on. Rings of sound pulse out and bounce back.","seconds":40,"lines":[{"i":3,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Distance Eyes! One sends a sound. One listens for the echo.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/3.ogg","dur":4.359,"env":"00tzuzn4lyqg8pkcrnlmliiljkd6glj300000000jsqlmmlppjrqljmjiscirkroljggacb72a400000000ozvsgmqswnorchohddik746sjbzy852upk43aqnfb2000000","words":[["Distance",0.06,0.69],["Eyes!",0.69,1.05],["One",1.36,1.62],["sends",1.62,1.98],["a",1.98,2.12],["sound.",2.12,2.49],["One",2.78,3.0],["listens",3.0,3.42],["for",3.42,3.65],["the",3.65,3.87],["echo.",3.87,4.14]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":4,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Fog can hide light. But sound goes right through it.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/4.ogg","dur":3.532,"env":"005zzuqpmi6455logka8fnjknpccqolihd5000700000000hz6dtvrotnkonilf4rvqnio86irpnmh704872itzxzvui5200di80000000","words":[["Fog",0.08,0.35],["can",0.35,0.61],["hide",0.61,0.93],["light.",0.93,1.31],["But",1.58,1.8],["sound",1.8,2.12],["goes",2.12,2.39],["right",2.39,2.71],["through",2.71,3.13],["it.",3.13,3.3]],"voice":"spark"}]},{"setting":"Amara stands in front of the robot and slowly steps closer.","action":"A number above the robot shrinks: 80… 50… 20. At 20, the robot’s eyes glow amber.","seconds":40,"lines":[{"i":5,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"The bumper feels a touch. Distance Eyes know BEFORE the touch.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/5.ogg","dur":3.972,"env":"00mec5zzwg9bpc764drnqmiena4f700idsqok5427jgc5000000000rzzpz5furjdtf20ksrspqphn4hsnpme3ba667utqk4r82dbohd302jnlf82000000","words":[["The",0.06,0.3],["bumper",0.3,0.69],["feels",0.69,1.03],["a",1.03,1.16],["touch.",1.16,1.49],["Distance",1.82,2.29],["Eyes",2.29,2.56],["know",2.56,2.84],["BEFORE",2.84,3.21],["the",3.21,3.43],["touch.",3.43,3.76]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":6,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Which is better for not bumping into a friend?","direction":"Pause for answers: Distance Eyes!","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/6.ogg","dur":2.626,"env":"00wy8cmfyzujlg5otockrrpe56gxmlmtoo64437zzydbvplprrskee8nqsm6545mzuomgc484000000","words":[["Which",0.08,0.38],["is",0.38,0.54],["better",0.54,0.89],["for",0.89,1.1],["not",1.1,1.31],["bumping",1.31,1.7],["into",1.7,1.96],["a",1.96,2.07],["friend?",2.07,2.42]],"voice":"spark"}]},{"setting":"The town square in fog. The bandstand is a dim shape; something rings on its steps: “ting… ting…”.","action":"The robot rolls forward and stops just before the bandstand steps — no bump. It turns, rolls, stops again. On the top step sits a little bell with a glowing light caught inside its handle.","seconds":45,"lines":[{"i":7,"who":"myrobot","guestName":null,"text":"Something is close. Stopping!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/7.ogg","dur":2.11,"env":"0007dzxh40lnpkne7a3022kokie42433000000000004849xzzl20die60000000","words":[["Something",0.1,0.6],["is",0.6,0.77],["close.",0.77,1.08],["Stopping!",1.45,1.9]],"voice":"myrobot"},{"i":8,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"Light eleven! It was ringing the bell every time the wind blew.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/8.ogg","dur":4.213,"env":"000000000ozxxsckzywxzvgstrqwsj7000000000000000000000jzvrzxkgmwzzzzzywjkxttuuqmbsvosxxuqgesywsqyvwqrsturxyq3jtommpsh200000000000","words":[["Light",0.31,0.64],["eleven!",0.64,1.03],["It",1.55,1.71],["was",1.71,1.91],["ringing",1.91,2.31],["the",2.31,2.51],["bell",2.51,2.77],["every",2.77,3.07],["time",3.07,3.32],["the",3.32,3.53],["wind",3.53,3.78],["blew.",3.78,4.03]],"voice":"amara"}]},{"setting":"The square fills with the shapes of people setting up stalls for tonight. Bolt dashes between their legs.","action":"A delivery cart rolls by; someone steps out right in front of the robot. Everyone freezes.","seconds":30,"lines":[{"i":9,"who":"guest","guestName":"Mr Okafor, the baker","text":"Careful! The square is full of people today — and so many children!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/9.ogg","dur":3.838,"env":"004iropn83bk84000000000004ognd00lxztsnmrihb32vwvsnob087utl25psc7aomrnljkha2000005jifiyrgtyuqtm39mtzrpb8jjfddb500000","words":[["Careful!",0.1,0.46],["The",0.86,1.06],["square",1.06,1.39],["is",1.39,1.54],["full",1.54,1.79],["of",1.79,1.94],["people",1.94,2.27],["today",2.27,2.56],["—",2.56,2.62],["and",2.62,2.82],["so",2.82,2.97],["many",2.97,3.22],["children!",3.22,3.63]],"voice":"okafor"},{"i":10,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"A robot in a crowd has a very big job: keep everyone safe.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S21/10.ogg","dur":4.681,"env":"00yvccozzzz7kvrg54hokqp74687usllmmmeb9kmoira75zyzuqrj63tzq630hlywqoonigc300000000000000000004cxvn42000qzs6isokkkkhe9hmyttjnsllige656400000000","words":[["A",0.08,0.25],["robot",0.25,0.